\item (Assumption \ref{assumpmb}) $M=\mathbb{R}^{d+c}$ with $d\ge 2,$ $W$ is a $(d-1)$-dimensional compact closed smooth submanifold or a $(d-1)$-dimensional compact subanalytic  set, $[\Sigma]\in H_d(M,W,\mathbb{Z})$  is a $d$-dimensional relative integral homology class, $g=\delta$ is the standard flat metric and $\Omega_g=\{g\}$.
